  "title_zh": "习近平《在纪念孙中山先生诞辰160周年大会上的讲话》单行本出版",
  "title_en": "Single-Volume Edition of Xi Jinping's Speech at Sun Yat-sen 160th Anniversary Commemoration Published",
  "summary_zh": "中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平《在纪念孙中山先生诞辰160周年大会上的讲话》单行本已由人民出版社出版，2026年11月24日起在全国新华书店发行。",
  "summary_en": "The single-volume edition of Xi Jinping's speech at the commemoration of the 160th anniversary of Sun Yat-sen's birth, published by the People's Publishing House, went on sale at Xinhua Bookstores nationwide on November 24, 2026.",
